Re-export fontconfig-dlopen through the cpp/core feature chain, and drop
the image/svg decoders from the cpp std feature set.

fontconfig-dlopen (i-slint-common) makes font discovery dlopen()
libfontconfig at runtime instead of linking it -- on this rootfs there is
no fontconfig and all fonts are compile-time embedded, so the probe just
soft-fails. The feature exists upstream but is not reachable from the
C++ API crate; add the two forwarding entries.

The std trim removes the runtime PNG/JPEG/SVG decoders: with
embed-for-software-renderer every image in .slint markup is pre-rendered
by the slint compiler, so the decoders are dead weight (~0.9 MB).

Upstream-status: local configuration for this target.

